  "description": "Guides developers through Google Ads API quickstart: credential setup, choosing from 6 client libraries/REST, configuring environments, and running a \"retrieve campaigns\" script. Troubleshoots common setup errors: USER_PERMISSION_DENIED, login_customer_id issues, and CLOUD_PROJECT_NOT_APPROVED_FOR_PRODUCTION (a Google Cloud project with Test access calling a production account).\n\nUse this skill when:\n- The user asks how to get started with the Google Ads API.\n- The user needs to set up Google Ads API access in a Google Cloud project or OAuth credentials.\n- The user wants to write a quickstart/example script for Google Ads.\n- The user encounters errors like USER_PERMISSION_DENIED, CLOUD_PROJECT_NOT_APPROVED_FOR_PRODUCTION, or the legacy DEVELOPER_TOKEN_NOT_APPROVED.",
